  voiceSubs:
  - It is good that thou hast arrived!
  - They have already begun the ritual, but with haste and virtue, we can put an
    end to it.
  - First thou must seek out and speak to the civilized inhabitants of the Abyss.
  - They will give invaluable aid in thy quest.
  - It will be challenging before thou see the end, and thy decisions and actions
    will not be easy.
  - I have faith in thee, Avatar!
